  {
   "id": "e9_bed",
   "music": "lament",
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "On the tenth day, with Shikhandi before him, Arjuna's arrows brought the grandfather down.",
     "hi": "दसवें दिन, शिखंडी को आगे रखकर, अर्जुन के बाणों ने पितामह को गिरा दिया।"
    },
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "He lay on a bed of arrows, and chose to wait, until the sun turned north, before he would die.",
     "hi": "वे बाणों की शय्या पर लेट गए, और उन्होंने प्रतीक्षा चुनी, जब तक सूर्य उत्तरायण न हो जाए।"
