  {
   "id": "e9_drona",
   "music": "sorrow",
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "Drona was next. Bhima killed an elephant named Ashwatthama, the same name as Drona's beloved son.",
     "hi": "अब द्रोण की बारी थी। भीम ने अश्वत्थामा नाम के एक हाथी को मारा, जो द्रोण के प्रिय पुत्र का भी नाम था।"
    },
    {
     "who": "YUDHI",
     "en": "Ashwatthama is dead...",
     "hi": "अश्वत्थामा मारा गया..."
    },
    {
     "who": "YUDHI",
     "en": "...the elephant.",
     "hi": "...हाथी।",
     "vol": 0.35,
     "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
     "who": "NAR",
     "en": "Krishna's conch drowned the last words. Drona laid down his weapons. And Yudhishthira's chariot, which had always floated above the earth, sank to the ground.",
     "hi": "अंतिम शब्द कृष्ण के शंख में डूब गए। द्रोण ने शस्त्र रख दिए। और युधिष्ठिर का रथ, जो सदा धरती से ऊपर चलता था, धरती पर आ गया।"
    }
   ],
